===============================================================================
YOU NEED A LEGAL COPY OF THE ORIGINAL GAME
===============================================================================

Epic Pinball HD is an unofficial, fan-made engine reimplementation. It does not
include, and is not, the game Epic Pinball.

* To play it, you need a legally obtained copy of Epic Pinball: the original
  CD or floppy release, or "Epic Pinball: The Complete Collection" sold by
  GOG.com.

* This project contains NO game assets. There is no artwork, music, sound,
  table data, text or code from the original game in this repository or in any
  application built from it.

* All this project does is use the original assets from your own copy. On first
  launch the app imports your copy (a CD image or the installed files), reads
  the original files, and uses their graphics, sounds, music, table layouts and
  rules at runtime. The imported data stays on your computer, in
  ~/Library/Application Support/EpicPinballHD/.

* Data made from your copy is for your personal use only, and must not be
  distributed. That includes the imported library, the developer outputs in
  extracted/, and HD/upscaled asset packs generated by tools/hdpack/. Please do
  not share game files or ask others for them. Buy the game instead.

* The file-format documentation and tools in this repository describe how the
  original data is laid out. They were written by analysing a legally owned
  copy, for interoperability with this reimplementation.

Epic Pinball and all of its original content (artwork, music, sound effects,
table designs, rules, text and program code) are the property of their
respective copyright and trademark holders. The game was developed by Digital
Extremes and published by Epic MegaGames (now Epic Games). This project is not
affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Epic Games, Digital Extremes,
GOG.com or any other rights holder. All trademarks belong to their respective
owners.

The app icon and all interface artwork in this repository are original work
created for this project.

